    <!-- Net Worth widget picker entries — separate AppWidgetProvider registrations (one real
         class each, see NetWorthWidgetProvider/NetWorthWidgetProviderCard.kt) so the home-screen
         widget picker shows each tier's own preview thumbnail as a distinct choice. Android
         only supports one android:previewLayout per provider, so "show all variants in the
         picker" requires one provider registration per variant — there's no single-widget way
         to do this. Every variant is still freely resizable across the full range afterward;
         only the starting size + picker thumbnail differ. -->
